    <p>Pricing, preparation, and presentation — sequenced so buyers see value without drama.</p>
  </div></section>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;"><div class="container prose" style="max-width:42rem;">
    <h2>Seller focus areas</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Comparable-based pricing — not wishful thinking</li>
      <li>Prep that actually moves offers</li>
      <li>Listing feedback loops and negotiation support</li>
    </ul>
    <p><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/home-value/">Get a home value consult</a></p>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>
